  "description": {
    "text": "The 2010 fall Collector's Tins, sold from September 2010, each held a holofoil shiny legendary beast, Raikou HGSS19, Entei HGSS20 or Suicune HGSS21, with a Cracked Ice holofoil copy of the same Pokémon's Secret Wonders card to show the two colorings side by side, and four booster packs: one each of Undaunted, HeartGold & SoulSilver, the Platinum series and the Diamond & Pearl series. A note inside promised more shiny Pokémon in future sets. The shiny cards' art first came in Japan in the LEGEND Perfect Set of July 2010.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: HeartGold & SoulSilver TCG Series merchandise",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/HeartGold_%26_SoulSilver_TCG_Series_merchandise"
      },
      {
        "title": "PokéBeach: Shiny Entei, Suicune, and Raikou Promos in Fall 2010 Tins (21 May 2010)",
